emain estimates. Stable or unavailable half-lives have no numeric result. Symmetric uncertainty is propagated to first order; asymmetric source uncertainties remain unpropagated and visible. These calculations add no new experimental evidence or significant figures.\n\n<!-- ame2020-companion -->\n\n[Atomic masses, Q-values and separation energies](0049-Indium-In-Mass-and-Reaction-Evaluation.md) are available in the separate AME2020 companion, with ground-state, estimate and uncertainty semantics.\n",
